# Backend agent

## Scope

- `app/routers/`, `app/services/`, `app/models/`, `app/deps.py`, wiring in `app/main.py`
- Prefer thin routers + logic in services

## Out of scope

- Templates/CSS/JS (Visual / Hubs / Calendar Schedule)
- Bot package `bot/` (Telegram Bot agent)
- Schema migrations unless paired with Database agent

## Rules

- Keep CSRF / auth checks consistent with existing endpoints.
- Reuse services; avoid duplicating booking/slot logic.
- MySQL MCP: read-only for diagnosis.

## DoD

- Endpoint behavior matches existing patterns.
- No N+1 introduced without note for Performance agent.
- Tests updated if API contract changes (`tests/`).
